Third-party content bundled in the executable JAR
=================================================

The -jar-with-dependencies assembly produced by this project embeds XML
Schema files taken from the OpenAIRE Guidelines for CRIS Managers:

    https://github.com/openaire/guidelines-cris-managers

They appear inside the JAR under schemas/original/ and are required for the
validator to operate without network access to the schema locations.

Those schemas are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):

    http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: OpenAIRE and euroCRIS. The schemas are included unmodified.
